  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "r0b0tlab's preferred serve of its NVFP4 export of XiaomiMiMo/MiMo-V2.6-Flash-RL on two GB10 Sparks: SGLang nightly 582389ce with tensor and expert parallel 2, Marlin MoE runner, calibrated FP8 KV cache, in-checkpoint EAGLE MTP (3 steps, 4 draft tokens), MiMo tool and reasoning parsers, and multimodal input (image; upstream also probed audio and video). Upstream default context 524,288 (model native 1M) with 8 running requests and a pinned 4096 draft window. Licences: r0b0tlab original work MIT, base model MIT, SGLang and the vendored patches Apache-2.0 (information only). Upstream claims +21% decode over the vendor MXFP4 checkpoint (median 69.1 vs 56.9 tok/s at bs=8); not measured here. The upstream DFlash lane is not selectable because options cannot remove the MTP arguments.",
